      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a bit hard to read, it\u0027s too wordy in some parts. How about:\n\nIn v3.7 of the Identity API service, two new configuration options were added: ``[resource] admin_project_name`` and ``[resource] admin_project_domain_name``. The options represent the project that only the cloud administratior should be able to access. When an authentication request for a token scoped to the admin project is processed, it will have an additional field in the token ``{is_admin_project: True}``. The additional field can be used when writing policy rules that evaluate access control to APIs.",
